  "body": "Stunning 1930s Bungalow – Character, Charm & Beautifully Presented!\r\n\r\nA truly beautiful character home, full of charm, warmth and timeless appeal, ready for it's next chapter....\r\n\r\n*Ready to relocate to your site and create a whole lot of wonderful new memories!*\r\n\r\nWith it's beautiful original character, gorgeous presentation and highly desirable three bedroom, two bathroom layout, this bungalow is a real standout!\r\n\r\nBoasting three good sized bedrooms, two gorgeous bathrooms, a separate laundry and a lovely modern kitchen, this highly sought after floor plan ticks all the boxes.\r\n\r\nThe character is undeniable, with two pretty bay windows, an abundance of windows flooding the home with natural light, and beautiful wooden joinery in great condition. The weatherboard exterior and iron roof are also in great condition.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living areas offer a lovely sense of space and flow, creating a welcoming environment for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom is a real highlight, featuring lovely doors opening outside, a walk-in wardrobe and it's own ensuite – a fantastic combination of comfort and practicality.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and in great condition throughout, this is a gorgeous character home that is sure to impress!\r\n\r\nA special home with timeless appeal – don't miss this opportunity to secure a stunning 1930s bungalow. Call now to arrange a viewing!! Reference: #Witi\r\n\r\nPrice includes GST and relocation within 100kms. Foundations included. Price is for house and relocation only (not the section).\r\n\r\nFor viewing or more information please contact me.\r\nCall/Text or email: Marissa on 0274 999 828 Email: marissa@nzhouseremovals.co.nz\r\n\r\nPrice does not include any Council fees, Architect drawings, Insurance or connections to services.\r\n\r\nWe can help you arrange your building consent and Insurance. Finance, subject to terms and conditions, can be arranged as well.\r\n\r\nUse our recommended Architect for your house Plans and applications with Council as well as Geotech, engineers and surveyor’s. Call or Text Marissa on 0274999828\r\n\r\nKEYWORDS: transportable home, transportable dwelling, transportable building, transportable house, relocatable house, relocatable dwelling, relocatable building, removable house, removable dwelling, removable home, removable building, villa, house for removal, building for removal, dwelling for removal, home for removal, house haulage, clear my site, houses for removal, homes for removal, buildings for removal, dwellings for removal, renovate, investment, house demolition, demolition, bungalow, character home, character dwelling, character building, development, investment opportunity, developments, preloved home, preloved house, secondhand house, second hand house, portable home, portable house.",
